cut off
fg impulse
ch t1 56
write test.impulse

cut 20 80
read test.impulse
lh b e

cut off
read test.impulse
lh b e

cut -10 80
read test.impulse
lh b e

cut 10 180
read test.impulse
lh b e

cut t1 80
read test.impulse
lh b e

cut t1 e
read test.impulse
lh b e


** Precision of time in Cutting

fg impulse delta 5e-3 npts 17279840
lh b e npts delta
write test.impulse
cut e -1200 0
read test.impulse
lh b e npts delta

